# M12 "Yetenek Yolları", flow "skills_warrior" run 3 at 1024x640 @150 % (the smallest logical screen,
# 683 x 427): the warrior of run 2 enters again; the stored ranks and bar came back (SKILL_STATE,
# SKILL_BAR); the "Yetenekler" window fits the screen and stays usable: a skill is dragged onto the
# window's own bar row (the window covers the HUD bar here) and its tooltip is shown; a buff's icon
# sits under the HUD panel; Esc closes the window first.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m12_war
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+skillsknown 1800
expect world+level10+skillpoints0+noraise+unlocked0_2+unlocked0_3+unlocked1_2+locked1_3
scene expectrank agir_darbe 3
scene expectrank yarma 3
scene expectrank kan_ofkesi 1
scene expectrank kalkan_duvari 2
scene expectrank meydan_okuma 1
scene expectslot 1 agir_darbe
scene expectslot 2 yarma
scene expectslot 3 kan_ofkesi
scene expectslot 4 meydan_okuma
scene expectslot 5 kalkan_duvari
wait 200
# Kan Öfkesi may still cool down from run 2 (the world keeps cooldowns 60 s after leaving).
waitfor world+ready_kan_ofkesi 3000
key 3
waitfor world+selfeffect_attack_up 120
wait 20
screenshot 01_hud_buff.png
key k
waitfor world+skillsopen 60
dragon skills.cell.kalkan_duvari skills.bar.6 16
waitfor world+barsets1+baridle 120
scene expectslot 6 kalkan_duvari
hoveron skills.bar.2
wait 3
expecttext skills.tooltip Yarma
expecttext skills.tooltip Hücum · Kademe 3/3
screenshot 02_window_bar_tooltip.png
hoveron skills.cell.sarsinti
wait 3
expecttext skills.tooltip Sarsıntı
expecttext skills.tooltip 1,5 sn sersemletir
screenshot 03_window_locked_skill.png
rclickon skills.bar.6
waitfor world+barsets2+baridle 120
scene expectslot 6 empty
key escape
waitfor world+skillsclosed 30
expect world+invclosed
quit
